### 3. Transaction with ROLLBACK | Transação com ROLLBACK

**File:** `11-transactions-error-handling.sql`

```sql
USE SQLRoadmapTrainingDB;
GO

BEGIN TRANSACTION;

UPDATE Products
SET StockQuantity = StockQuantity - 2
WHERE ProductName = 'Mouse Logitech'
AND StockQuantity >= 2;

SELECT *
FROM Products
WHERE ProductName = 'Mouse Logitech';

-- Undo changes
-- Desfazer alterações
ROLLBACK TRANSACTION;
GO
```

### 4. Transaction with COMMIT | Transação com COMMIT

```sql
